## Real-World Applications

* Moving data from a database into a spreadsheet.
* Filtering customer or business data.
* Using database information to send emails.
* Connecting AI to a database.
* Replacing repeated database tasks with an automated workflow.
* Using local AI instead of paying for an online API.
* Connecting several tools together in one process.

